  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/01/IMG_7246.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Un cami&oacute;n de gran tonelaje, cargado de arena, ha volvado hacia las 7.30 horas de este viernes en la carretera CV-20, a la altura del Apeadero de Betx&iacute;, justo en la rotonda donde est&aacute; el monolito que da la bienvenida a Onda. El conductor ha salido ileso y s&oacute;lo se han destrozado dos farolas, que tendr&aacute; que reponer el Ayuntamiento.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiovolcatbaixadorbetxi/img_7233.jpg\" alt=\"img_7233\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiovolcatbaixadorbetxi/img_7234.jpg\" alt=\"img_7234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiovolcatbaixadorbetxi/img_7235.jpg\" alt=\"img_7235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiovolcatbaixadorbetxi/img_7236.jpg\" alt=\"img_7236\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiovolcatbaixadorbetxi/img_7237.jpg\" alt=\"img_7237\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiovolcatbaixadorbetxi/img_7238.jpg\" alt=\"img_7238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiovolcatbaixadorbetxi/img_7239.jpg\" alt=\"img_7239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiovolcatbaixadorbetxi/img_7240.jpg\" alt=\"img_7240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/camiovolcatbaixadorbetxi/img_7241.jpg